Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:46.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}勒纳·钱 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}4 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 孟菲尔斯 · 赛后告别仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.28,0:00:05.64,EN,,0,0,0,,G, you have given so much to this city,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.28,0:00:05.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你为这座城市付出了太多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:07.88,EN,,0,0,0,,these fans, this sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,为这些球迷，为这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:08.44,EN,,0,0,0,,We would love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们很想听你说说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:11.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to hear how much it's all meant to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一切对你意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:13.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Good evening, New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:13.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,晚上好，纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:20.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:20.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想谢谢你们所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's been a long ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是很长的一段路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:26.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I came here in 2003 for the juniors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:26.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我2003年来这儿打青少年组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.68,0:00:30.92,EN,,0,0,0,,for the first time and here I am in 2026.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.68,0:00:30.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是第一次，而现在是2026年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:33.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's a had a long ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:33.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的是很长的一段路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:38.60,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.32,0:00:38.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以，非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:41.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I felt all this year the love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:41.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一年我一直感受着这份爱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:44.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and I can tell you you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:44.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.12,0:00:46.92,EN,,0,0,0,,are my second best crowd of course
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.12,0:00:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们是我第二好的观众
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:49.72,EN,,0,0,0,,after Paris but you're up there so thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:49.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然，排在巴黎之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:52.96,EN,,0,0,0,,so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:52.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,太感谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:58.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I just want to just to tell you it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:58.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只想告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:01:00.52,EN,,0,0,0,,been a absolute honor for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:01:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对我是莫大的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:02.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to play all this year in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些年能在你们面前打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:03.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Try my best,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:03.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,尽我所能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:06.68,EN,,0,0,0,,try to perform high performance tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出高水平的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:08.28,EN,,0,0,0,,but also give you a great show
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:08.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,同时也给你们一场好看的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:09.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and you guys give me great love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:09.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,而你们给了我巨大的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:11.40,EN,,0,0,0,,So, you know, I will never forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:11.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我永远不会忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:13.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you very much for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:13.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:23.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, Gael, now USTA CEO Craig Tiley and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:23.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,美国网协CEO克雷格·泰利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:26.60,EN,,0,0,0,,US Open tournament director Eric Butorac
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:26.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,和美网赛事总监布托拉克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:31.04,EN,,0,0,0,,are going to present you with a special gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:31.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,将为你送上一份特别的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.56,0:01:41.48,EN,,0,0,0,,What a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.56,0:01:41.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,多么重要的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:43.96,EN,,0,0,0,,For the final time here in New York,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:43.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,在纽约的最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:47.30,EN,,0,0,0,,let's hear it for Gael Monfils.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:47.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我们为孟菲尔斯欢呼
